---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy of Orbint GmbH.">
  <Nav />

  <main class="main">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: January 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Controller</h2>
        <p>
          The controller responsible for data processing on this website is:<br /><br />
          Orbint GmbH<br />
          Lilienthalstraße 9<br />
          85579 Neubiberg, Germany<br />
          E-Mail: <a href="mailto:info@orbint.de">info@orbint.de</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Data collected when visiting this website</h2>
        <p>
          When you visit this website, our server automatically collects certain technical data
          transmitted by your browser: IP address, date and time of access, pages visited, browser
          type and version, operating system, and referrer URL. This data is processed on the basis
          of Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest) to ensure the security and stability
          of our web infrastructure. Log files are deleted after 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Contact form</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact us via the contact form, the data you submit (name, email address,
          organization, message) will be stored and used solely to process your inquiry and for any
          follow-up questions. The legal basis is Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR (contract performance
          or pre-contractual measures) or, where applicable, Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate
          interest). Data is not passed on to third parties without your consent. We delete inquiries
          once they are no longer needed and no statutory retention obligations require their storage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Google Fonts</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses Google Fonts, provided by Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway,
          Mountain View, CA 94043, USA. When a page loads, your browser connects to Google's servers
          to retrieve the font files, which may transfer your IP address to Google. Google Fonts is
          used on the basis of Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest in consistent
          typography). For more information, see Google's Privacy Policy at
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to your personal data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request erasure of your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@orbint.de">info@orbint.de</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .main {
    padding-top: 8rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    min-height: 80vh;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  ul {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

  a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
